{
 "ep": "show1",
 "pace": 12,
 "lines": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "t": 19,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "各位觀眾朋友，大家好！歡迎收看一字千金，我是主持人，增國城！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "t": 25.6,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "今天是兒童特別節目！六位小朋友要來挑戰國字、成語……還有我的耐心。",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "t": 33.93,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "我們先來認識一下今天的小朋友！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "t": 43.38,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第一位小朋友，你好，請自我介紹！",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "t": 47.04,
   "who": "lei",
   "cast": "xiaolei",
   "text": "我叫陳小雷！我最快！我今天一定第一個按鈴！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "t": 52.150000000000006,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "我還沒出題，你就按了。這樣很浪費電耶。",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "t": 57.440000000000005,
   "who": "lei",
   "cast": "xiaolei",
   "text": "沒關係！我先按，再想！",
   "feel": "proud"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "t": 60.050000000000004,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "很好，很有個性……很有個性。下一位！",
   "feel": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "t": 65.73,
   "who": "han",
   "cast": "shuhan",
   "text": "大家好，我是林書涵，十歲。我讀過兩百本書，最喜歡成語辭典。",
   "feel": "proud"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "t": 72.12,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "成語辭典……你當故事書在看？",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "t": 75.36,
   "who": "han",
   "cast": "shuhan",
   "text": "對啊。還有主持人，嚴格來說，其中一位已經十五歲，不算小朋友。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "t": 82.56,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "我主持二十幾年，第一次被小朋友糾正。",
   "feel": "sad"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "t": 88.94,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "那我們來看看是哪一位……你是小朋友嗎？你比我還高耶。",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "t": 95.19999999999999,
   "who": "rui",
   "cast": "yirui",
   "text": "在下奕叡，龍門刀莊人士，今年十五……虛歲十六。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "t": 100.32999999999998,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "「在下」？你是從古裝劇的片場，直接走過來的嗎？",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "t": 106.45999999999998,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "還有你背後那把刀……我們是比寫字，不是比砍字喔。",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "t": 113,
   "who": "rui",
   "cast": "yirui",
   "text": "主持人放心。刀不出鞘，只出字。",
   "feel": "proud"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "t": 117.25,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "好帥！這句我要拿去用。",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "t": 121.06,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "旁邊這位小朋友，你為什麼帶了一顆足球來？",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "t": 125.56,
   "who": "shuo",
   "cast": "yishuo",
   "text": "我是奕碩，他是我哥！這是我的球，我去哪裡，它就去哪裡！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "t": 131.53,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "那比賽的時候，它要去哪裡？",
   "feel": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "t": 134.56,
   "who": "shuo",
   "cast": "yishuo",
   "text": "它可以幫我按鈴！你看——",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "t": 139.38,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "……好，這顆球，我先幫你保管。我們這是「一字千金」，不是「一腳千金」。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "t": 148.62999999999997,
   "who": "shuo",
   "cast": "yishuo",
   "text": "啊——我的球！",
   "feel": "sad"
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "t": 153.79999999999995,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "這位小朋友……你在吃什麼？",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "t": 156.82999999999996,
   "who": "bao",
   "cast": "dabao",
   "text": "雞腿。我緊張的時候，就會想吃東西。",
   "feel": "shy"
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "t": 160.69999999999996,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "那你什麼時候不緊張？",
   "feel": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "t": 163.09999999999994,
   "who": "bao",
   "cast": "dabao",
   "text": "吃飽的時候。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "t": 165.85999999999996,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "我懂，我也是。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "t": 168.62999999999994,
   "who": "bao",
   "cast": "dabao",
   "text": "我叫王大寶！我的專長是吃很多，而且吃很快！",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "t": 174.93999999999994,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "最後一位，妹妹你好，你叫什麼名字？",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "t": 178.80999999999995,
   "who": "yuan",
   "cast": "yuanyuan",
   "text": "……張圓圓。",
   "feel": "shy"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "t": 180.36999999999995,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "什麼？大聲一點，後面的阿姨會聽不到喔。",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "t": 184.95999999999995,
   "who": "yuan",
   "cast": "yuanyuan",
   "text": "……張、圓、圓。",
   "feel": "shy"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "t": 187.33999999999997,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "好。我跟各位說，通常越小聲的，越可怕。",
   "feel": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "t": 195.13,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "好！六位小朋友都到齊了，比賽正式開始！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "t": 204.01999999999998,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第一關，字音大考驗！搶答正確的讀音，答對一百分！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "t": 209.35999999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第一題——",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "t": 211.60999999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "小雷，我「第一題」三個字才剛說完而已。",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "t": 216.5,
   "who": "lei",
   "cast": "xiaolei",
   "text": "烏龜裂開！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "t": 219.25,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "烏龜裂開……很有畫面，但是錯了。",
   "feel": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "t": 224.01,
   "who": "han",
   "cast": "shuhan",
   "text": "念君裂。君裂，就是乾得裂開，像田裡的土一樣。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "t": 230.32999999999998,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "答對了！一百分！書涵果然是看辭典長大的。",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "t": 234.82999999999998,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第二題——",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "t": 238.27999999999997,
   "who": "bao",
   "cast": "dabao",
   "text": "辛辛……辛拉麵學子？",
   "feel": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "t": 242.27999999999997,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "大寶，你的腦袋裡，是不是只有菜單？",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "t": 246.14999999999998,
   "who": "bao",
   "cast": "dabao",
   "text": "還有甜點。",
   "feel": "shy"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "t": 249.39999999999998,
   "who": "rui",
   "cast": "yirui",
   "text": "念身身學子，形容學生眾多。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "t": 253.72999999999996,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "正確！奕叡很穩喔，跟他的刀一樣穩。",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "t": 257.59999999999997,
   "who": "shuo",
   "cast": "yishuo",
   "text": "哥好厲害！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "t": 258.94999999999993,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第三題——",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "t": 261.19999999999993,
   "who": "shuo",
   "cast": "yishuo",
   "text": "一爆十寒！像我的球一樣，一踢就爆！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "t": 266.36999999999995,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "你的球爆了，我們節目也要爆了。",
   "feel": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "t": 271.41999999999996,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "圓圓有按嗎？我看到燈亮了……圓圓，請回答。",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "t": 276.12999999999994,
   "who": "yuan",
   "cast": "yuanyuan",
   "text": "……鋪。一鋪十寒。",
   "feel": "shy"
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "t": 279.61999999999995,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "什麼？再說一次？",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "t": 281.79999999999995,
   "who": "yuan",
   "cast": "yuanyuan",
   "text": "……鋪。曬太陽的意思。",
   "feel": "shy"
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "t": 285.60999999999996,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "答對了！我就說吧，越小聲的，越可怕！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "t": 292.0899999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第一關結束！書涵、奕叡、圓圓各一百分，其他三位零分……但是笑點滿分！",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "t": 303.5299999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第二關，錯字大搜查！成語裡有一個錯字，請把它找出來！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "t": 309.2899999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第一題，再接再勵。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "t": 311.9799999999999,
   "who": "lei",
   "cast": "xiaolei",
   "text": "再接再……再接一次！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "t": 314.9799999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "你是在接電話嗎？",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "t": 318.55999999999995,
   "who": "shuo",
   "cast": "yishuo",
   "text": "「勵」錯了！要寫「厲害」的「厲」！我爹每次都說：碩兒，要再接再厲！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "t": 326.98999999999995,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "答對了！看來你爹常常要你再接再厲喔？",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "t": 331.06999999999994,
   "who": "shuo",
   "cast": "yishuo",
   "text": "因為我常常踢破燈籠。",
   "feel": "shy"
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "t": 334.86999999999995,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第二題，迫不急待。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "t": 337.55999999999995,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "小雷，又是你！這次你想好了嗎？",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "t": 341.1099999999999,
   "who": "lei",
   "cast": "xiaolei",
   "text": "想好了！「急」錯了，要寫「及格」的「及」！迫不及待！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "t": 347.8699999999999,
   "who": "lei",
   "cast": "xiaolei",
   "text": "耶——我終於有分數了！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "t": 350.4799999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "恭喜！先按再想，終於想對了一次！",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "t": 355.7399999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第三題，一股作氣。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "t": 358.9299999999999,
   "who": "rui",
   "cast": "yirui",
   "text": "「股」應為「鼓」，擊鼓的鼓。《左傳》有云：一鼓作氣，再而衰，三而竭。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "t": 367.6699999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "哇，連出處都說出來了！你家是開補習班的嗎？",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "t": 372.6799999999999,
   "who": "rui",
   "cast": "yirui",
   "text": "是開刀莊的。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "t": 375.8399999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "最後一題，走頭無路。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "t": 379.2399999999999,
   "who": "bao",
   "cast": "dabao",
   "text": "走頭……是不是走去吃豬頭？",
   "feel": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "t": 383.8699999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "大寶，我建議你比賽完，先去吃飯。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "t": 388.52999999999986,
   "who": "shuo",
   "cast": "yishuo",
   "text": "「頭」錯了！是「投」，投球的投！走投無路！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "t": 394.4399999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "只要跟球有關係的，你都會耶！",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "t": 397.67999999999984,
   "who": "shuo",
   "cast": "yishuo",
   "text": "球是我的老師！",
   "feel": "proud"
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "t": 400.4499999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第二關結束！奕叡、奕碩兩百分領先，大寶……還在暖身。",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "t": 406.80999999999983,
   "who": "bao",
   "cast": "dabao",
   "text": "我是大器晚成！",
   "feel": "proud"
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "t": 409.3799999999998,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "欸！這個成語你用得很好耶！可惜這一關已經結束了。",
   "feel": "surprised"
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "t": 418.71999999999986,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第三關，成語填空！每題兩百分，可能大翻盤喔！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "t": 423.6399999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第一題：畫蛇添——什麼？",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "t": 426.85999999999984,
   "who": "shuo",
   "cast": "yishuo",
   "text": "足！足球的足！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "t": 429.72999999999985,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "我就知道！這題根本是幫你出的嘛。",
   "feel": "happy"
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "t": 433.9899999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "第二題：對牛彈——什麼？",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "t": 437.8099999999999,
   "who": "bao",
   "cast": "dabao",
   "text": "牛……牛肉麵！",
   "feel": "excited"
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "t": 441.47999999999985,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "對牛彈牛肉麵……那頭牛應該很感動。",
   "feel": "thinking"
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "t": 447.14999999999986,
   "who": "han",
   "cast": "shuhan",
   "text": "琴，彈琴的琴。比喻對不懂的人講道理，白費力氣。",
   "feel": "calm"
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "t": 453.4799999999999,
   "who": "host",
   "cast": "host",
   "text": "答對了！就像我現在，叫小雷不要先按鈴一樣。",
